body:
Let's pull the common (and most important) line of code out of the conditional:
```suggestion
  XReg load_value = load_reserved<<%= current_size[:load_reserved_bits] %>>(virtual_address, aq, rl, $encoding);

<%- if size == "w" -%>
  if (xlen() == 64) {
    X[xd] = load_value;
  } else {
    X[xd] = sext(load_value[31:0], 32);
  }
<%- else -%>
  X[xd] = load_value;
<%- end -%>
```
